,"identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257964","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"青葉りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5968","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉りんご","detail":"ハッピーエンド曲「always here with you」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:260926","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"Rita(理多)","creatorId":"vndb:s102","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5819","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s102","name":"Rita(理多)","detail":"バッドエンド曲「遠い記憶　燻る欲望」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:260927","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"青葉 りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉 りんご","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189873","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"綾瀬 はづき","creatorId":"vndb:s580","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s580","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s580","name":"綾瀬 はづき","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189874","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"nao","creatorId":"vndb:s935","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s935","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s935","name":"nao","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189877","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"黒田 晶見","creatorId":"vndb:s3559","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3559","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3559","name":"黒田 晶見","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189879","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"天ヶ咲 麗","creatorId":"vndb:s4314","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4314","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4314","name":"天ヶ咲 麗","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189881","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Rita","creatorId":"vndb:s102","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s102","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s102","name":"平井 理子","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189884","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c117684","characterName":"枢木 静那","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"119883","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"405687"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24378"],"vndbCharacterId":"c117684"},"originalCharacterName":"枢木 静那","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1020"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"93"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seina lost her father at a tender age and grew up in a single-parent household. With a younger brother to care for and a mother who was always busy with work, Seina assumed all the domestic chores during her academic days. Though she's level-headed and reliable, she has a slightly ingenuous side to her as well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seina has a strong maternal instinct and is always nurturing others. Likewise, she can't resist the urge to offer her support when she witnesses a man's careless or piteous side. Her empathetic nature runs deep, and her dedication knows no bounds once she devotes herself to someone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Until she started college and found a job, Seina was on the verge of developing a distrust for men. But meeting Subaru helped put her heart at ease. Though Subaru excels at his career, his daily life is in disarray, and Seina feels compelled to support him, bringing them closer together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eventually, Subaru mustered up the courage to confess his feelings, and they started dating. Six months later, he proposed, and they tied the knot. Seina continued to work but transferred to a different department to avoid mixing her personal and professional life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Coffee, Cleaning, Budget-friendly cosmetics"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Celery, Horror"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c117684"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"早くに父親を亡くしていて、母子家庭で育つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生時代は幼い弟がいたこともあり、仕事で忙しい母親の代わりに、家事全般を担っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"落ち着いたしっかり者ではあるが、やや天然の部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母性本能が強く面倒見が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面、男性のだらしない部分や、情けない部分を見ると、自分が支えてあげなくては、と思ってしまうタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"情も厚い為、一度身体を許してしまうと、とことん尽くす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"進学して就職するまでは、やや男性不信になりかけていたが、昴と出逢ったことでようやく気持ちが落ち着く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その昴は、仕事はとても出来るが日常生活がだらしないため、自分が支えてあげなくてはと思い、距離が縮まっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やがて意を決した昴からの告白を受けて交際し、半年後にプロポーズを受けて結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事はまだ続けているが、公私混同を避ける為に部署は変わった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24378","sourceWorkId":"33350","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"早くに父親を亡くしていて、母子家庭で育つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生時代は幼い弟がいたこともあり、仕事で忙しい母親の代わりに、家事全般を担っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"落ち着いたしっかり者ではあるが、やや天然の部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母性本能が強く面倒見が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面、男性のだらしない部分や、情けない部分を見ると、自分が支えてあげなくては、と思ってしまうタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"情も厚い為、一度身体を許してしまうと、とことん尽くす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"進学して就職するまでは、やや男性不信になりかけていたが、昴と出逢ったことでようやく気持ちが落ち着く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その昴は、仕事はとても出来るが日常生活がだらしないため、自分が支えてあげなくてはと思い、距離が縮まっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やがて意を決した昴からの告白を受けて交際し、半年後にプロポーズを受けて結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事はまだ続けているが、公私混同を避ける為に部署は変わった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"119883"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"119883","value":"コーヒー、掃除、100均コスメ"},{"label":"嫌いなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"119883","value":"セロリ、ホラー"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24378","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24378","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24378","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24378","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24378","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/7373e5404d45775f1f7d9512f0a8414afde6f67dbbfa6955d8584c506937c4a9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/005e04c9b15d9e2eb70059ed742aec094e79cb4498bdac5ccfd67835fa1ea2a2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南月悠奈","creatorId":"vndb:s692","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s692","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s692","name":"水瀬 沙季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:405687:119883:6349:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c117685","characterName":"志藤 紗絵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"119884","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"405687"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24379"],"vndbCharacterId":"c117685"},"originalCharacterName":"志藤 紗絵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"707"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sae is Subaru's junior by one year in college. After graduation, she followed in his footsteps and landed a job at the same company. She's been head over heels for him since their college days, but before she could confess, their senior-junior relationship blossomed into a close friendship, making it harder for her to express her true feelings. Sae has eyes only for Subaru and has even remained a virgin, saving herself for him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite working at the same company, their relationship stayed platonic. By the time Sae mustered up the courage to confess, Subaru had already begun dating Seina, leaving her nursing a broken heart. Even so, Sae can't let go of her feelings for Subaru and finds herself unable to fall for other men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Before crossing paths with Subaru in college, Sae had dabbled in love. However, her trusting nature often led her into situations where she felt pressured to get physical, although she never went all the way. Amidst this, she gradually fell for Subaru, who treated her respectfully and saw her for more than just her looks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Sae falls in love, she falls hard, often becoming blind to everything else around her. She's the type who would go to the ends of the earth for her beloved. Sae lives in a studio apartment in the same building as Subaru and the gang, in the section designated for single residents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Outdoors, Alcohol, Chocolate"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Centipedes, Corns on feet"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c117685"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"昴の大学時代の一年後輩で、その後を追うようにして、同じ会社に就職した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当時から恋心を抱いているが、打ち明ける前に先輩後輩という関係を越えて、友人になってしまった為に、告白できずにいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ずっと昴のことだけを想い続けて、処女を守り通している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ会社に入ってからもその関係が続き、気が付いた時には昴は静那と付き合っており、打ち明ける前に失恋する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでもまだ諦めきれず、他の男性を好きになれないでいる状態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学で昴と出逢うまでに、それなりに恋愛は経験しているが、隙の多いタイプである為、すぐに肉体関係を迫られることが多かったが、最後の一歩は踏み出せなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中で、自分を女性として意識せずに接してくれた昴に、徐々に惹かれるようになっていった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きになったら周りが見えなくなるタイプで、求められることは全て受け入れてしまう性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昴達と同じマンションの、独身者用の部屋に住んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24379","sourceWorkId":"33350","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"昴の大学時代の一年後輩で、その後を追うようにして、同じ会社に就職した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当時から恋心を抱いているが、打ち明ける前に先輩後輩という関係を越えて、友人になってしまった為に、告白できずにいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ずっと昴のことだけを想い続けて、処女を守り通している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ会社に入ってからもその関係が続き、気が付いた時には昴は静那と付き合っており、打ち明ける前に失恋する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでもまだ諦めきれず、他の男性を好きになれないでいる状態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学で昴と出逢うまでに、それなりに恋愛は経験しているが、隙の多いタイプである為、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すぐに肉体関係を迫られることが多かったが、最後の一歩は踏み出せなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中で、自分を女性として意識せずに接してくれた昴に、徐々に惹かれるようになっていった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きになったら周りが見えなくなるタイプで、求められることは全て受け入れてしまう性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昴達と同じマンションの、独身者用の部屋に住んでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"119884"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"119884","value":"アウトドア、お酒、チョコレート"},{"label":"嫌いなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"119884","value":"多足類、魚の目"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24379","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24379","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24379","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24379","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24379","sourceWorkId":"33350","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d20b7be26e0d34bfb7f635f4a5f1558b2ebe81c4138f258b693cc1f6aef3eebd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a56079db4eb52b3e17f333263c1328b39cf67761f49a7ca70a5571040db3cfba.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:405687:119884:17080:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"綾音 まこ","creatorId":"vndb:s2581","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2581","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2581","name":"綾音 まこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:93046","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c117686","characterName":"枢木 昴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"119885","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"405687"}],"egsCharact